# Mc-Git — Code owners
#
# This file controls automatic reviewer assignment on pull requests.
# Documentation: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositories-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Order matters: the *last* matching pattern takes precedence.
# Patterns follow .gitignore syntax (but only file globs, not negations).
#
# NOTE: replace `@mc-sources/maintainers` with the actual GitHub team or
# individual handle if no `maintainers` team exists on the `mc-sources` org.

# Default owner — every PR is assigned to the maintainers team unless a more
# specific rule below overrides it.
*                               @mc-sources/maintainers

# CI / release workflows — change with care, only maintainers should review.
/.github/workflows/             @mc-sources/maintainers

# Community standards — code of conduct, contribution policy, security policy.
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md             @mc-sources/maintainers
/CONTRIBUTING.md                @mc-sources/maintainers
/SECURITY.md                    @mc-sources/maintainers
/SUPPORT.md                     @mc-sources/maintainers
/.github/                       @mc-sources/maintainers

# Rust backend
/src-tauri/                     @mc-sources/maintainers

# Frontend
/src/                           @mc-sources/maintainers

# Specs and architecture documents
/docs/                          @mc-sources/maintainers
